OL,3,GNEWSAStabbed teen's sister awarded for
OL,4,Aknife crime work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose brother was stabbed to
OL,7,Fdeath has won an award for the role she
OL,8,Fhas played in tackling knife crime
OL,9,Fsince he was killed.
OL,11,FShanine Wright's 16-year-old brother,
OL,12,FDarrian Williams, died after he was
OL,13,Fattacked in Easton's Rawnsley Park on
OL,14,FValentine's Day 2024.
OL,16,FWright has since delivered knife crime
OL,17,Fprevention workshops in schools,
OL,18,Fdistributed bleed kits, worked
OL,19,Falongside the Home Office, and has now
OL,20,Ftaken home a BBC Radio Bristol Make a
OL,21,FDifference Award
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
