OL,3,GNEWSAStabbed teen's sister awarded for
OL,4,Aknife crime work
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-two finalists were shortlisted
OL,7,Fat The Playhouse Theatre in
OL,8,FWeston-super-Mare on Thursday for going
OL,9,Fabove and beyond to help others, with
OL,10,Feight winners announced on the night.
